%
( X VERNIER CALIBRATION SWEEP  -  AIR ONLY, MOVES X ONLY, SPINDLE OFF          )
( docs/handoffs/2026-11-10-x-vernier-commissioning.md, step 3                   )
( Start capture.sh 150 OUT.txt first, then run this. About 2 minutes.           )
( X travels from XD up to XD + 0.5 dia and back, slowly, at three feeds, then   )
( makes ten short back-and-forth reversals for backlash. Z never moves.         )
( Set XD so there is 0.5 dia of clear travel above it.                          )
#<xd> = 2.0000
#<span> = 0.5000
N10 G20 G7 G18 G90 G94 G40 G49 G80
N20 M5
N30 G00 X[#<xd>]
N40 G04 P1.0
( three speeds: slow edges for the map, faster ones for drive lag )
N50 G01 X[#<xd> + #<span>] F0.6
N60 G04 P0.5
N70 G01 X[#<xd>] F0.6
N80 G04 P0.5
N90 G01 X[#<xd> + #<span>] F1.5
N100 G04 P0.5
N110 G01 X[#<xd>] F1.5
N120 G04 P0.5
N130 G01 X[#<xd> + #<span>] F3.0
N140 G04 P0.5
N150 G01 X[#<xd>] F3.0
N160 G04 P0.5
( backlash: ten .010 dia reversals, stepping up .020 each time )
#<i> = 0
o100 while [#<i> LT 10]
  G01 X[#<xd> + 0.020 * #<i> + 0.010] F0.6
  G04 P0.3
  G01 X[#<xd> + 0.020 * #<i>] F0.6
  G04 P0.3
  #<i> = [#<i> + 1]
o100 endwhile
N900 G00 X[#<xd>]
N910 M2
%
